    "# PIDGN-T Training Demonstration Notebook\n",
    "\n",
    "## Explainable Temporal Graph Learning for Multimodal Neurogenetic Data Integration in Early Parkinson's Disease Prediction\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Overview\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates the complete training workflow of the proposed PIDGN-T framework.\n",
    "\n",
    "The objective is to provide a reproducible implementation example showing how the proposed multimodal temporal graph model is initialized, optimized, and prepared for evaluation.\n",
    "\n",
    "The training pipeline follows the methodology described in the manuscript:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Genomic SNP representation learning using Genomic Autoencoder\n",
    "- Structural MRI feature extraction using 3D convolutional encoder\n",
    "- Longitudinal clinical representation learning using LSTM encoder\n",
    "- Biological graph construction\n",
    "- Cross-Modal Graph Attention Fusion (CM-GAF)\n",
    "- Temporal Graph Neural Network (TGNN)\n",
    "- Multi-objective optimization and classification\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook corresponds to:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Section 3.2: Modality-Specific Feature Extraction\n",
    "- Section 3.3: Graph Construction and Representation\n",
    "- Section 3.4: Cross-Modal Graph Attention Fusion\n",
    "- Section 3.5: Temporal Graph Neural Network\n",
    "- Section 3.7: Optimization and Objective Function\n",
    "\n",
    "Repository: PIDGN-T"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
