    "\n",
    "This section imports all required libraries and PIDGN-T modules.\n",
    "\n",
    "The implementation assumes the repository structure:\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "PIDGN-T/\n",
    "├── models/\n",
    "├── training/\n",
    "├── preprocessing/\n",
    "├── evaluation/\n",
    "└── data/\n",
    "```\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
