    "- Perform independent evaluation experiments\n",
    "- Generate explainability results\n",
    "- Reproduce reported performance metrics\n",
    "\n",
    "The saved model contains the learned parameters of:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Genomic encoder\n",
    "- MRI encoder\n",
    "- Clinical temporal encoder\n",
    "- Graph fusion module\n",
    "- TGNN temporal reasoning module\n",
    "- Classification head\n"
   ]
  },
  {
