   "source": [
    "# 12. Reproduction Notes\n",
    "\n",
    "This section provides guidelines for reproducing the experimental results reported in the PIDGN-T manuscript.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Software Requirements\n",
    "\n",
    "Recommended environment:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Python >= 3.9\n",
    "- PyTorch >= 2.0\n",
    "- CUDA-enabled GPU environment\n",
    "- Required packages listed in requirements.txt\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "## Random Seed Configuration\n",
    "\n",
    "To evaluate training stability, experiments should be repeated using different random seeds:\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "42\n",
    "123\n",
    "456\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "The reported experimental results are obtained from multiple independent runs and summarized using mean values and variability measurements.\n"
   ]
